   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE MAKER'S DIMENSIONED DRAWING. Rittal, \"Technical details, Power Distribution Unit, Basic version\" (dri2108028en, 08.2023), PDF page 21, DK 7979.140: a plan view (the back), a side view, an end view and a front view, with the circuit diagram below. The cell lines of the front view were read from a 600 dpi render of that page at the drawing's own scale: the 1494 overall length between the two ends of the front view reads at 1.94 px per mm, the scale the DK 7979.175 page gives. Each cell edge is a full-height line of the front view. Good to about 1 mm. This page's own reading is used; no position is taken from another model. The offsets of an outlet in its cell are the DK 7979.175 model's."
  },
